--- OVERVIEW: Simulations ---

General-purpose NNP-driven MD runs of the ppimg2 (bimagnesium pyrophosphate complex) system,
using the ArcaNN iteration-006 committee, separate from the pph3/pph4 LFER/PMF machinery in
../LFER_3_mg2/ and ../NNP_LFER_choice/.

o TS_OPES/    OPES metadynamics exploring the transition-state region (5 replicas) —
              see its README.
o prod_MD/    single reference production MD run — see its README.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
